# Endpoint the contact form POSTs its JSON payload to.
# Leave unset and the form falls back to opening the visitor's mail client.
#
# Examples:
#   Formspree   VITE_CONTACT_ENDPOINT=https://formspree.io/f/xxxxxxx
#   Own Flask   VITE_CONTACT_ENDPOINT=https://api.quantyx.com/contact
VITE_CONTACT_ENDPOINT=
